.TH MYSTRLEN 3 "September 2026" "libmyutils 1.0" "libmyutils Manual"
.SH NAME
mystrlen \- calculate the length of a string
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mystrfunctions.h"
.sp
.BI "int mystrlen(const char *" s ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mystrlen()
computes the length of the string pointed to by
.I s,
not including the terminating null byte.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the number of characters in the string
.IR s .
.SH AUTHOR
Your Name <your.email@example.com>
